  "title": "Physical Vs Digital Vs Audio books: Which is better?",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "physical-vs-digital-vs-audio-books-which-is-better"
  },
  "publishedAt": "2025-03-28T10:19:37",
  "excerpt": "If you are a reader, then it is sure that books have always been your friend. No matter whether you [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "596204b0ffcd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "94e20e81e47c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you are a reader, then it is sure that books have always been your friend. No matter whether you are a student or just a passionate reader, you have always found a way to read a book. People used to carry a book in their backpacks. They would hold it in their hand and read it. However, things have changed now. With the development of various technologies, you can carry millions of books in the palm of your hand with the help of devices like kindle. Not only this, in case you don’t want to read, you can simply listen to audiobooks as well. E-books and audiobooks have changed the reading habit of people. This article is all about physical digital and audiobooks However, these regular, digital, and audiobooks have their pros and cons."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "60f0473ae30b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bf0bd502d348",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros and Cons of Digital Books"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cb70443e1703",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dc2f618baaad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Digital books have brought new reading habits. You can store hundreds of books on your phone or E-readers like kindle. Just carry it and you can read it anywhere whether it’s day or night. Here is the list of pros and cons of digital or E-books."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5a85abefc70e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6dbc37206fe9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pros:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "158474651388",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "93c6116fd360",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You can fit hundreds or even thousands of e-books on your device and read them anywhere."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1a623a5a8243",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "589d6bc96573",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You can change the font size as well as style according to your choice. As it comes with various features, even a visually impaired person can read it without any trouble."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1fc9306a837a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c24aed84bfc9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Digital books come with a built-in dictionary which can help you to know the meaning of complex words."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "595171e36970",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2c8ba040cdbd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With a mess-free library in your hand, digital books offer the feature to view all your highlights at a glance."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "78b5f535426d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b8dc5e61b39f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cons:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4955ed363f4d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1831c9df8e61",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "While reading an Ebook, you may get distracted when your phone buzzes off with notifications."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72b536c16e99",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3fb70136f9e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Though the battery lasts for a longer period, you still have to charge your phone or Kindle."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8f57205d325d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "73e91da696f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You cannot get a physical copy of your favorite book when it comes to digital books."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d4605671da6e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4dfa6285c84e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros and Cons of Regular Books"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "667e120d1534",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "088079d424ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Holding their favorite book while taking a sip of coffee is still a favorite pastime for most people. The smell of the new book brings a different kind of happiness to readers. No matter how various kinds of technologies get developed, people still prefer regular books over others. Let’s discuss the pros and cons of regular books."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0308895d6408",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "61fca29c48ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ab0e726bfd00",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8b697e3cfbce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    You can read your book in peace without worrying about if your phone or e-reader’s battery is dead."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6cd798c10aef",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e899cee3bb8a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    You can easily lend and borrow any physical book with your friends and loved ones."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5958ff61e52a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0cc333c4b5da",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    While your phone may buzz off anytime with notifications, your regular book will never distract you with notifications."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "221a4b60485f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b683d0017cb3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    Sometimes you highlight or mark your favorite quote in the book. Years later, you can look back at the book and enjoy reading the notes again."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "457c65397611",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3e5c99000de7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cons:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ceba2d45838d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "886bb6081922",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    While reading a book, you will need a good source of light. You can’t read a book in the dark."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "643e72f5c774",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bbc2e7a6d165",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    If we look in the long term, buying books is more expensive than owning E-readers."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9b53b92a74a5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9ad01a4e8bc3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    Regular books are not portable compared to E-readers."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c0d27d189b5d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6f5bf7e903c7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    Physical books allow you to keep a library and display everything you’ve read or plan to read. They can be used as décor too. "
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0d42e06343ed",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2530fea50c91",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros and Cons of Audio Books"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72b74fd757b7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4cb34246ebb1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Audiobooks are revolutionary as even when you are too tired to turn the pages of your book or when you don’t spend too much time on screen, it allows you to listen to your favorite book. These books have made the information found in books accessible to everyone. Physical digital and audiobooks, it has more advantages. However, these also have their advantages and disadvantages which are mentioned below:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "75f570b984c1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e2ce31177a35",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c733c8e72033",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ":"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2c5e3c3ad135",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "79743d691716",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    No matter what you are doing, you can always listen to an audiobook. You don’t need to schedule a separate time for reading."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "554c18b49384",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "58ea2dc3125c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    You can be anywhere: flying in a plane or working in a kitchen and still listening to audiobooks."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1ca89c239127",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d725f8e6181b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    Even if you are out in the dark, you can listen to audiobooks."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "406346c1b454",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4f2885d6d6cd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    You can multitask while listening to audiobooks."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3610d24e8b0e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "265b648ad22c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    If you have a smaller place, you don’t have to worry about where to keep your books."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3706c739a3eb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4fef5f20bdbf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cons:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "34509012a5e7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0ff801080bbd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    You cannot highlight or mark your favorite part as in physical or digital books."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5cdbf04c69bd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b7c2f1d49e51",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    Audiobooks take up a relatively large amount of space on your device."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9f2fa6ac61a8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ae364ac20a74",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    They are comparatively more expensive than both eBook and their physical edition."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b4ebf15bec7f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d76cc11bcb45",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "    You need access to power to consume audiobooks which means your device should be well-charged."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0dbf537513d8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bad6db6f7c66",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you are wondering which is best among these three, you don’t have to. All three types of books i.e physical digital and audiobooks come in handy to people according to their needs. For example, a visually impaired person relies on audiobooks whereas a bookaholic can prefer physical books. Thus, find the one that is most suitable for you and start reading."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
